  "text": "```verilog\nmodule synchronizer #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk,\n    input  rstn,\n    input  async_sig_i,\n    output sync_sig_o\n);\n\n    reg [STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rstn) begin\n        if (!rstn) begin\n            sync_reg <= {STAGES{1'b0}};\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[STAGES-2:0], async_sig_i};\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign sync_sig_o = sync_reg[STAGES-1];\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
